Z||000004||fierospeeder||11-27-2001||03:26 PM||||my fiero has barely any paint on the hood, roof, and engine lid.<P>But its like brand new paint on the sides. &lt;drool&gt;  Homer simpson "original shiney paint on sides uuuhhhhhh"<P><BR>Im going to put up my ceiling when i get some money in the garage.  About 200 bucks for the wood, 2X6.  Then drywall.  Im going to build a hood with a furnace filter in the ceiling.  Some large tarp in a rectangle and i will be painting.  <P>two intake fans will be in the windows and im going to use a 50-60dollar fan thats in the sears/harbor freight catalog to transfer bad/good air.  Its going to connect the ceiling hood and suck out dust and fumes outside with a exhaust port on the overhang.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Fiero Technician<P>74 Vw Beetle<BR>83 Honda Nighthawk 550<BR>84 Pontiac Fiero<BR>87 Ford Thunderbird Turbo<P>Selling a car is like giving your own kid for adoption.||||reg||1
